description: NestJS backend conventions for EstateX
globs: apps/api/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# Backend

- Feature modules by domain. Thin controllers. Logic in services. Prisma only via `PrismaService`.
- Validate every write with DTOs + class-validator. Use the global exception filter.
- Guards for JWT and roles. Ownership checks in the service after loading the resource.
- Derive `agentId` from the property. Never trust client-supplied agent IDs.
- Paginate list endpoints. Select only required fields. Avoid N+1 (use `include` / `select` deliberately).
- Rate-limit public auth and inquiry endpoints. Helmet + CORS from env.
- Swagger decorators on public-facing controllers.
- Never return `passwordHash` or refresh token hashes.
